proxmox-backup-client (4.2.0-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial community/unofficial packaging of the Proxmox Backup client suite
    (proxmox-backup-client, pxar, proxmox-file-restore) built from upstream
    Rust sources at tag v4.2.0.
  * File-level restore only; VM/block-image restore path is out of scope.

